Concede that irreversible-harm systems warrant pre-deployment auditing, and reversible-harm systems warrant post-deployment auditing. This:
- Aligns with your stated intention [acc-intentions-008]
- Avoids the incoherence of claiming you support pre-deployment auditing for high-stakes systems while opposing pre-deployment gates
